---
import styles from "./About.module.css";
---

<section id="about" class={styles.about}>
  <div class:list={["container", styles.aboutInner]}>
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h2>A developer who builds the tools she wishes existed.</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a software developer working through my own complicated health journey, and a lot of
      what I build comes from real needs — calm, private tools that make a messy thing feel
      manageable. I care about clear interfaces, honest software, and shipping.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of my work lives in TypeScript with React, Astro, and Supabase. When I'm not coding
      I'm probably wrangling a herd of guinea pigs.
    </p>
    <div class={styles.ctaRow}>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:hayley@duke.co">Get in touch</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/hayleycodes">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
